   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-36-260923-to-161023-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-36-260923-to-161023-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-36  - 26/09/23 to 16/10/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>26 September 2023 and 16 October 2023</strong>. We allocated <strong>335.08</strong> TEC tokens for rewards. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/c321de64d87d4883523a76a2d4437baebcf5f532/distribution_rounds/round-36/distribution_results/executed_notebooks/output_01-general-round-analysis.ipynb\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=12\" title=\":bar_chart:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>This post will 